# The backend image is built from the repository root (see backend/Dockerfile),
# because it needs deploy/olm. Without this file that context is the frontend's
# node_modules and the whole git history — hundreds of megabytes uploaded to the
# daemon on every build, none of it in the image.
.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend
docs
graphify-out
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/data
*.md
!deploy/olm/README.md
